<title>PORTUGAL: Technical problems halt Lisbon bourse trade.</title>
<headline>Technical problems halt Lisbon bourse trade.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technical problems halted trade on the Lisbon bourse soon after the start, with the PSI20 share index losing over two percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>The problems also affected trade in the cash bond market.</p>
<p>Bourse officials could not be immediately contacted to comment on the nature of the problem or on how long it could take to resolve.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
